        "text": "According to U.S. Solicitor General (Petitioners), according to U.S. Solicitor General (Petitioners), petitioners argued that the COVID\u201119 pandemic caused widespread economic distress, leading the Secretary to invoke the HEROES Act to suspend interest and payment obligations for all federally held student loans."
